
>> countries := لسٹ نیا
	~ ⌝'Switzerland'⌜
	~ ⌝'Italy'⌜
	~ ⌝'Germany'⌜.

>> foods := لسٹ نیا
	~ ⌝'Rösti'⌜
	~ ⌝'Spaghetti'⌜
	~ ⌝'Sauerkraut'⌜.


>> counter := 0.
foods بلحاظ: countries, ہر-ایک: ⎬ :key :value
	counter جمع: 1.
⎨.

آؤٹ-پٹ لکھو: ﴿⌝'we serve counter dishes'⌜ counter: counter﴾, نئی-سطر.

>> counter := 42.
⌝'TrytosortthiswithoutsegfaultingButActualNumberDe✎dsOnOS'⌜ حروف ترتیب: ⎬ :v
	counter جمع: 0.
⎨.

آؤٹ-پٹ لکھو: ﴿⌝'we sort counter dishes'⌜ counter: counter﴾, نئی-سطر.


>> counter := 0.
⎬
	⎬
		counter جمع: 1.
	⎨ × ﴿3 + 1 + 1 × 0.5﴾.
⎨ × 100.


آؤٹ-پٹ لکھو: ﴿⌝'we calculate counter numbers.'⌜ counter: counter﴾, نئی-سطر.

